    "Ticket revenue": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ticketeinnahmen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesamt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total debt": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesamtschulden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two letters, painted on every aircraft in your fleet. Can't match a real airline (UA, DL…).": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zwei Buchstaben, auf jedem Flugzeug deiner Flotte. Darf keiner echten Airline entsprechen (UA, DL…)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "UNDERSTAFFED — %lld/%lld routes (benefits suspended, bills continue)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "UNTERBESETZT — %lld/%lld Routen (Vorteile ausgesetzt, Kosten laufen weiter)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Underserved markets you don't fly yet — tap one to preview it on the map.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unterversorgte Märkte, die du noch nicht bedienst — tippe einen an, um ihn auf der Karte zu sehen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unlock Full Game": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vollversion freischalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upgrade for more hubs, a global network, and the endgame.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upgrade für mehr Drehkreuze, ein weltweites Netzwerk und das Endgame."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch the numbers": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behalte die Zahlen im Auge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome aboard ✈️": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen an Bord ✈️"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome back to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen zurück bei %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome, COO!": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen, COO!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's painted on the fuselage — usually a short form of your name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was auf dem Rumpf steht — meist eine Kurzform deines Namens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your first customer is calling": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein erster Kunde ruft an"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your goal is to build a profitable global airline. You'll start small — one aircraft, one route — and grow it flight by flight.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dein Ziel ist eine profitable, weltweite Fluggesellschaft. Du startest klein — ein Flugzeug, eine Route — und wächst Flug für Flug."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rivals build hubs, go public, and buy airlines. So can you — unlock the full game.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deine Konkurrenten bauen Drehkreuze, gehen an die Börse und kaufen Airlines. Du kannst das auch — schalte das volle Spiel frei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
